# Pull request descriptions

Follow `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`.

Fill in "Links" when you open the PR, not after the deploys finish. Vercel preview URLs follow from the branch name: run `pnpm preview-urls` (or `pnpm preview-urls <branch> [fork-owner]`) and deep-link from the printed base URLs. Don't write "pending".
